 demo, and many took the time to write reviews, fill out our survey, and post on the forums. We read all of it. Your feedback became the backbone of our plans for the full game.Here's a small taste of what you asked for and what we're working on:Old mausoleums","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:20:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691736","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3367810-1835236783574486","game_id":"steam-3367810","kind":"announcement","title":"Cemetery Simulator Digs Into Steam Next Fest","summary":"Hello, gravekeepers.Cemetery Simulator has shuffled its way into Steam Next Fest, and the demo is open for business. Grab a shovel, tidy up the plots, dig a few holes, and put a friend to work in co-op while you are at it.Before anything else: thank you. A surprising number of you took the time to fill out our feedback survey, and we read all of it: the kind words, the bug reports, and the brutally honest \"I wouldn't buy it in its current state.\" That last one stung a little, but you are right, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-16T14:13:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783574486","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3367810-1834602721185475","game_id":"steam-3367810","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update | 03-06-2026","summary":"Changelog:Fixed coffin placement in various keyboards languages","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-03T17:24:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721185475","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3367810-1833968530897143","game_id":"steam-3367810","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update | 01-06-2026","summary":"Hello,Thank you for playing my demo! I hope you liked it! I saw a few issues with the keyboard and fixed them in today's update!Changelog:Fixed \"E\" key not working on other keyboard layouts than QWERTY & AZERTYAdded Survey button in the main menuJust a reminder about Demo version content:Small forest cemetery: Develop and manage a charming location hidden among the trees.Solo or with a team: Play together with 1 to 4 players.Client orders: Complete missions and tasks related to organizing classi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-01T10:21:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530897143","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3367810-1833968530890866","game_id":"steam-3367810","kind":"announcement","title":"Cemetery Simulator Demo is OUT NOW on Steam! 💥","summary":"Grab your shovel and start building the most profitable necropolis around! Build, decorate, and expand your cemetery: Organize funerals from start to finish Clean graves, collect trash, and keep the place tidy Play solo or in up to 4-player co-op chaos","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-29T12:11:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530890866","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3367810-1833968530889345","game_id":"steam-3367810","kind":"announcement","title":"Grab Your Shovels! The Demo Drops in Less Than 24 Hours 🪦","summary":"Hey Everyone, We have some grave news... The Cemetery Simulator demo is officially launching in less than 24 hours! And the best part? You don’t have to suffer the graveyard shift alone. The demo features full online Co-Op! Before we hand over the keys to the cemetery gates, grab your future business partner and check out our brand-new trailer to see what you're getting yourselves into: What is Cemetery Simulator?For those of you just joining us (welcome to the afterlife's waiting room!), Cemete","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-28T20:22:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530889345","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3367810":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:37:04Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:37:04Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3367810":"2026-10-26T10:37:04Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3367810":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:37:04Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:37:04Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:37:04Z"},"3367830":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:37:04Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:37:04Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:37:04Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3367810","app_id":3367810,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:17Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"3e698d2756ae470e834bbdedaf423ba6ca231f79b04bf16b0511d0d49b8fec70","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"팀원들과 관을 나르고 최고의 공동묘지를 만드세요! 무덤을 파고, 관을 내리고, 주변을 깔끔하게 유지하세요. 구역을 장식해 명성을 얻고 새로운 구역을 여세요. 솔로 또는 최대 4인 협동 모드로 플레이하며 기물 파손범과 유령에 맞서세요!","publishers":[{"name":"Ultimate Games S.A.","creator_clan_account_i